  "severity": "Important",
  "description": "Cockpit component for managing libvirt virtual machines.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* lodash: lodash: Arbitrary code execution via untrusted input in template imports (CVE-2026-4800)\n\n* lodash: Lodash: Prototype pollution allows deletion of built-in prototype properties via array path bypass (CVE-2026-2950)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n\nAdditional Changes:\n\nFor detailed information on changes in this release, see the Rocky Linux 9 Release Notes linked from the References section.",
